{"kind":"finding","id":"FN-B-alerts-phone-tracker-components-2-b-01","date":"2026-11-26","lens":"gap-4","surface":"phone","area":"phone/tracker-components-2","refs":["F-phone-817"],"severity":"S3","title":"A gym reply pops up with the app open, but the Gym tab's red count stays at zero","what":"The red count on the Gym tab adds up gym news, the gym's replies in Message your gym, and trainer replies. When a trainer reply arrives, the phone asks for a fresh count at once, so the red number goes up. When the gym itself replies, the phone only shows the pop-up: nothing asks for a new count. The number stays at zero until the member opens the Gym tab, or leaves the app and comes back more than 5 minutes after the last check. A member who swipes the pop-up away while on the Workout tab sees no sign of the reply anywhere.","expected":"A reply from the gym raises the Gym tab's red count at the same moment as its pop-up, just as a trainer reply already does.","evidence":["apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:360-368","apps/mobile/src/shop/noticeAlertsRun.ts:380-385","apps/mobile/src/shop/gymTalkSync.ts:51-64","apps/mobile/src/tracker/components/TrackerTabBar.tsx:257-262","apps/mobile/src/tracker/services/workoutAlerts.ts:95-105"],"proof":"code-read","root_cause_key":"gym-reply-push-skips-count","who":"members","how_often":"every gym reply that arrives while the app is open","fix_line":"When a gym reply arrives, ask for the Gym tab count again straight away, the same way trainer replies do","fix_size":"small","needs_him":false,"verified":"pending","status":"open"}
